	            <div class="flex flex-col">
	                <h2 class="mb-sm">Wir verwenden Cookies</h2>
	                <div>
  <p>
Wir setzen Cookies ein, um die Nutzung unseres Webauftritts f&uuml;r Sie komfortabler zu gestalten. Wir m&ouml;chten zudem Ihr Nutzungsverhalten besser verstehen, um Inhalte und Funktionen kontinuierlich zu verbessern. Bitte stimmen Sie daher der Nutzung folgender Cookies zu. N&auml;here Informationen zu den von uns gespeicherten Daten finden Sie in unserer <a class="group link inline-flex cursor-pointer gap-xs text-blue-darkest hover:text-blue" href="https://www.dvka.de/de/global/datenschutzbestimmungen.html" title="" target="_self"> <span class="flex flex-col"> <span class="flex items-center flex-1 group-focus:underline group-hover:underline font-bold"> Datenschutzerkl&auml;rung </span> </span> </a>.</p>
	                </div>
	            </div>
	            <div class="my-sm flex flex-wrap items-center gap-md">
	                <div>
	                    <div class="relative flex flex-row-reverse justify-end gap-xs">
	                        <label id="option_required-label" for="option_required"class="pt-px text-blue-darkest cursor-not-allowed self-center rounded-none bg-transparent">
	                        	Notwendig
	                        </label>
	                        <input aria-labelledby="option_required-label" type="checkbox" id="option_required" name="option_required" disabled checked
	                               class="undefined border-blue h-6 w-6 cursor-not-allowed flex-shrink-0 appearance-none rounded-none border bg-transparent">
	                        <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-6 w-6 checkbox pointer-events-none absolute text-blue" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
	                            <path d="M2 0a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2zm10.03 4.97a.75.75 0 0 1 .011 1.05l-3.992 4.99a.75.75 0 0 1-1.08.02L4.324 8.384a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06-1.06l2.094 2.093 3.473-4.425a.75.75 0 0 1 1.08-.022z"></path>
	                        </svg>
	                    </div>
	                    <div class="ml-1 mt-2 grid-cols-[auto,_1fr] gap-1 text-red hidden" data-error="true"><p>*</p></div>
	                </div>
	                <div>
	                    <div class="relative flex flex-row-reverse justify-end gap-xs">
	                        <label id="option_statistic-label" for="option_statistic" class="pt-px text-blue-darkest cursor-pointer self-center rounded-none bg-transparent">
	                        	Statistik
	                        </label>
	                        <input aria-labelledby="option_statistic-label" type="checkbox" id="option_statistic" name="option_statistic" class="undefined border-blue h-6 w-6 cursor-pointer flex-shrink-0 appearance-none rounded-none border bg-transparent">
	                        <svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-6 w-6 checkbox pointer-events-none absolute text-blue hidden" height="24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
	                            <path d="M2 0a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2zm10.03 4.97a.75.75 0 0 1 .011 1.05l-3.992 4.99a.75.75 0 0 1-1.08.02L4.324 8.384a.75.75 0 1 1 1.06-1.06l2.094 2.093 3.473-4.425a.75.75 0 0 1 1.08-.022z"></path>
	                        </svg>
	                    </div>
	                    <div class="ml-1 mt-2 grid-cols-[auto,_1fr] gap-1 text-red hidden" data-error="true"><p>*</p></div>
	                </div>
	                <button type="button" aria-label="Details anzeigen" aria-controls="cb-faq" aria-expanded="false"
	                 class="btn min-h-[44px] py-xxs px-sm flex justify-center items-center focus:underline hover:underline bg-transparent border border-1 border-blue text-blue-darkest hover:border-blue-darkest cb-details-toggle"
	                >
	                	<span>Details anzeigen</span>
	                	<svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" height="24" width="24"
	                	 class="cb-details-toggle__icon origin-center text-current transition-all duration-300 ease-out" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
